OL,3,AUkraine faces 'toughest winter' since
OL,4,ARussia's full-scale invasion, UN
OL,5,Aofficial tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking in Ukraine, De Croo ` the UN's
OL,8,Fthird most senior official ` accused
OL,9,FRussia of systematically targeting the
OL,10,Fcountry's energy infrastructure. He
OL,11,Fsaid there was now a "race against the
OL,12,Fclock" to repair the power network
OL,13,Fbefore winter sets in and temperatures
OL,14,Fplummet.
OL,16,FRussia and Ukraine have been
OL,17,Fintensifying aerial attacks in recent
OL,18,Fmonths, and both deny deliberately
OL,19,Ftargeting civilian infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
